            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Legend of Slime</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the leader of slime, and play a match-three puzzle game!</strong></h2><br>You will lead the slimes to adventure in a randomly generated world!<br>Set your route, and play the match-three game.<br>The world is scattered with a variety of things. Ancient ruins, quiet lakes, and even the battlefields of gods, are waiting for you.<br>Slimes are able to evolve! Under your leadership, they will become faster, stronger, and smarter!<br><br>Feature:<br> - The world is randomly generated<br> - So many wonderful encounters<br> - You can evolve, and make yourself a perfect slime<br> - A funny match-three game<br> - Slimes are happy and cute =)",
